<section class="w-full relative rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#121215]/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 shadow-2xl space-y-8 overflow-hidden font-sans">
  <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">DIAGNOSTIC PROTOCOL</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">How To Run This Display Test (01, 02, 03)</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-white shadow-inner">01</div>
      <h3 class="text-white font-semibold font-sans">Preparation</h3>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Clean your monitor surface, disable ambient light sensors, and set your display to native resolution and refresh rate.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-white shadow-inner">02</div>
      <h3 class="text-white font-semibold font-sans">Execution</h3>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Enter full-screen mode (F11) and use the diagnostic suite controls to progress through the test patterns.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-white shadow-inner">03</div>
      <h3 class="text-white font-semibold font-sans">Evaluation</h3>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Observe anomalies from different viewing angles in a dark room. Reference our E-E-A-T guides to interpret your results.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>